{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/4/df4d10456b3b45d2b7742fd1339ca9bd444edaee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + b^2 = (a - x)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"19\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/0/2201962aa95c8820189363b014e026cfbff30c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{b^2 + a^2}{2a}\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{b^2 - a^2}{2a}\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{a^2 - b^2}{2a}\\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{a - b}{2}\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{a^2 - b^2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"580\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solve for x:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/8/618e051c79dcf1343e17838c080fcc19f7dd98f9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2+b^2=(a-x)^2\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/6/e760124bbc73451cc04a74284f5ff2f29c2e4f7c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2+b^2=x^2-2ax+a^2\\]\" width=\"186\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/2/0f23779400136d4596801721ec63ea4e1afee3d8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^2=-2ax+a^2\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/f/26f3ed802b7ad898ac2a2f61ea1d9ced6591f36c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2ax=a^2-b^2\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0e2e1fb57791129ec18f5cca711cf679045552f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{a^2-b^2}{2a} \\to \\boxed{\\text{(C)}}\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Pr